Plural sections open, and the prompt has a mouth
===============================================

Every plural entry in the sidebar was a label with nothing under it. Projects, Artifacts, Cron jobs and
Tools & skills now carry a chevron: the label still navigates to the page, the chevron opens a short
list of what is actually in there — six most recent, click one to go to it. Open/closed is remembered
per section.

The list is drawn from what the app already holds (state.projects, state.artifacts, state.schedules,
the skills index); nothing new is fetched, and an empty section simply opens to nothing.

The composer placeholder was "Write your prompt to QuixiDesk". It now says what a person would say:

    You gonna talk to me or what?

Both the placeholder and its aria-label changed, so a screen reader gets the same sentence.
